{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["A screen for the entrance of the tent — since there is no curtain there, only the half-curtain that is doubled above." "Screen (מסך) — like masikh. And likewise magen, magin. Therefore, even when they are in construct state they are not pointed with hatef at their beginning, because they are verb forms, as written: מסך פתח אהל מועד. Magin of an entrance. And likewise (II Samuel 1): מגן שאול בלי משוח בשמן. But davar, bakar — which are noun forms — when in construct state are pointed with hatef: בְּקַר זבח השלמים. D'var hashmeta."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:14.003692632Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}